      "description": "meme-id: no_less_beautiful; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic; overall-intent-description: The image shows a smiling woman in a patterned dress standing in front of a backdrop with the 'Royal Television Society' logo. The text 'no less beautiful' is overlaid in large white letters. The scene is celebratory and positive, likely intended to convey admiration for the woman's appearance or achievement. There are no elements suggesting toxicity, abuse, cyberbullying, harmfulness, hate, misogyny, or propaganda. The intent is to affirm beauty and positivity, using the juxtaposition of the text with the image to reinforce a message of appreciation and confidence.",
