      "instance_name": "tilda_swinton",
      "label": "Tilda Swinton",
      "description": "The woman in the image is Tilda Swinton, a renowned British actress known for her distinctive appearance and versatile roles in film, television, and theater. Her presence in the image is significant because she is a well-known public figure whose beauty and style are often the subject of public admiration and media commentary. Recognizing her as Tilda Swinton adds context to the meme’s intent — it is not just about any woman, but about a celebrated, iconic figure being affirmed.",
