      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "celebrity admirers and media culture enthusiasts",
      "description": "The target community is fans, followers, and members of the media and entertainment industry who appreciate and celebrate public figures like Tilda Swinton. The meme leverages the 'no less beautiful' format, commonly used in social media to affirm the beauty or achievements of celebrities, especially in contexts of comparison or criticism. The presence of the Royal Television Society backdrop indicates the event is industry-related, further targeting those engaged with television and film culture. The celebratory and positive tone appeals to audiences who enjoy uplifting, affirming content about iconic figures.",
